L	FloodcombatBrute	A Jiralhanae taken by the Flood. Its left arm has become a long, jointed claw, tendrils sprout where its head once sat, and the head itself hangs slumped on its shoulder, still wearing its rank's helmet. It keeps a Brute's bulk and strength, fires whatever weapon it held when it fell, and leaps in to tear at you with the claw. Like every combat form, it may rise again unless it is torn apart.
